<title>USA: CME's Mexican pesos to open earlier beginning Mon.</title>
<headline>CME's Mexican pesos to open earlier beginning Mon.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade in Mexican peso futures and options on futures on the Chicago Mercantile Exchange (CME) will open earlier at 0720 CDT/0820 EDT/1220 GMT beginning on Monday, June 23, the CME said.</p>
<p>Trade in the Mexican instruments has so far opened at 0800 CDT/0900 EDT/1300 GMT.</p>
<p>Approval from the Commodity Futures Trading Commission (CFTC) is expected within one business day of this notice, the exchange said.</p>
<p>((-- Derivatives desk 312 408-8750))</p>
